      {
        "endIndex": 565,
        "paragraph": {
          "elements": [
            {
              "endIndex": 565,
              "startIndex": 466,
              "textRun": {
                "content": "Source of Truth 優先順序：官方兩份 PDF 的題幹與答案 > SPEC 的功能規則 > App DB 的結構與既有錯題。不要用網路常識或新版 Windows 知識修改官方題庫答案。\n",
                "textStyle": {}
              }
            }
          ],
          "paragraphStyle": {
            "direction": "LEFT_TO_RIGHT",
            "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT"
          }
        },
        "startIndex": 466
      },
      {
        "endIndex": 566,
        "paragraph": {
          "elements": [
            {
              "endIndex": 566,
              "startIndex": 565,
              "textRun": {
                "content": "\n",
                "textStyle": {}
              }
            }
          ],
          "paragraphStyle": {
            "direction": "LEFT_TO_RIGHT",
            "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT"
          }
        },
        "startIndex": 565
      },
      {
        "endIndex": 585,
        "paragraph": {
          "elements": [
            {
              "endIndex": 585,
              "startIndex": 566,
              "textRun": {
                "content": "請依 SPEC 完整建置 v0.1：\n",
                "textStyle": {}
              }
            }
          ],
          "paragraphStyle": {
            "direction": "LEFT_TO_RIGHT",
            "headingId": "h.cztz8ao3jtrl",
            "namedStyleType": "HEADING_1"
          }
        },
        "startIndex": 566
      },
      {
        "endIndex": 669,
        "paragraph": {
          "elements": [
            {
              "endIndex": 669,
              "startIndex": 585,
              "textRun": {
                "content": "1. 解析兩份官方 PDF，寫入 Questions，建立全域唯一 question_id，保留來源 section、原題號、頁碼、A-D、標準答案、解析與來源原文。\n",
                "textStyle": {}
              }
            }
          ],
          "paragraphStyle": {
            "direction": "LEFT_TO_RIGHT",
            "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT"
          }
        },
        "startIndex": 585
      },
      {
        "endIndex": 768,
        "paragraph": {
          "elements": [
            {
              "endIndex": 768,
              "startIndex": 669,
              "textRun": {
                "content": "2. 缺圖／依賴圖片題標 requires_media=true；圖片未可靠帶入前 enabled=false。解析不明、非四選一、缺答案或重複無法唯一辨識時標 needs_review，不准猜。\n",
                "textStyle": {}
              }
            }
          ],
          "paragraphStyle": {
            "direction": "LEFT_TO_RIGHT",
            "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT"
          }
        },
        "startIndex": 669
      },
      {
        "endIndex": 800,
        "paragraph": {
          "elements": [
            {
              "endIndex": 800,
              "startIndex": 768,
              "textRun": {
                "content": "3. 匯入後產出兩份題庫 QA 摘要並抽查每份至少 20 題。\n",
                "textStyle": {}
              }
            }
          ],
          "paragraphStyle": {
            "direction": "LEFT_TO_RIGHT",
            "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT"
          }
        },
        "startIndex": 768
      },
      {
        "endIndex": 880,
        "paragraph": {
          "elements": [
            {
              "endIndex": 880,
              "startIndex": 800,
              "textRun": {
                "content": "4. 將 WrongQuestions 目前 4 筆 pending_match 舊錯題匹配到 Questions；無法唯一匹配則 needs_review。\n",
                "textStyle": {}
              }
            }
          ],
          "paragraphStyle": {
            "direction": "LEFT_TO_RIGHT",
            "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT"
          }
        },
        "startIndex": 800
      },
      {
        "endIndex": 941,
        "paragraph": {
          "elements": [
            {
              "endIndex": 941,
              "startIndex": 880,
              "textRun": {
                "content": "5. 建立手機優先 Web App / PWA：首頁、測驗、作答、結果、錯題、統計；底部主導覽為首頁／測驗／錯題／統計。\n",
                "textStyle": {}
              }
            }
          ],
          "paragraphStyle": {
            "direction": "LEFT_TO_RIGHT",
            "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT"
          }
        },
        "startIndex": 880
      },
      {
        "endIndex": 997,
        "paragraph": {
          "elements": [
            {
              "endIndex": 997,
              "startIndex": 941,
              "textRun": {
                "content": "6. 支援 5 題、10 題、20 題模擬考、錯題重刷；同場不可重複題目。v0.1 不打亂 A-D 選項順序。\n",
                "textStyle": {}
              }
            }
          ],
          "paragraphStyle": {
            "direction": "LEFT_TO_RIGHT",
            "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT"
          }
        },
        "startIndex": 941
      },
      {
        "endIndex": 1031,
        "paragraph": {
          "elements": [
            {
              "endIndex": 1031,
              "startIndex": 997,
              "textRun": {
                "content": "7. 練習模式作答後立即回饋；模擬考 20 題完成前不可公布答案。\n",
                "textStyle": {}
              }
            }
          ],
          "paragraphStyle": {
            "direction": "LEFT_TO_RIGHT",
            "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT"
          }
        },
        "startIndex": 997
      },
      {
        "endIndex": 1090,
        "paragraph": {
          "elements": [
            {
              "endIndex": 1090,
              "startIndex": 1031,
              "textRun": {
                "content": "8. 答錯後可標「真的不會」或「題目看反」；前者進 WrongQuestions，後者只進 ReviewNotes。\n",
                "textStyle": {}
              }
            }
          ],
          "paragraphStyle": {
            "direction": "LEFT_TO_RIGHT",
            "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT"
          }
        },
        "startIndex": 1031
      },
      {
        "endIndex": 1131,
        "paragraph": {
          "elements": [
            {
              "endIndex": 1131,
              "startIndex": 1090,
              "textRun": {
                "content": "9. WrongQuestions 連續答對 2 次改為已熟悉；再答錯回待複習。\n",
                "textStyle": {}
              }
            }
          ],
          "paragraphStyle": {
            "direction": "LEFT_TO_RIGHT",
            "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT"
          }
        },
        "startIndex": 1090
      },
      {
        "endIndex": 1183,
        "paragraph": {
          "elements": [
            {
              "endIndex": 1183,
              "startIndex": 1131,
              "textRun": {
                "content": "10. 20 題模擬考以 80 分為達標線；16/20=80 顯示達標，15/20=75 顯示未達標。\n",
                "textStyle": {}
              }
            }
          ],
          "paragraphStyle": {
            "direction": "LEFT_TO_RIGHT",
            "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT"
          }
        },
        "startIndex": 1131
      },
      {
        "endIndex": 1269,
        "paragraph": {
          "elements": [
            {
              "endIndex": 1269,
              "startIndex": 1183,
              "textRun": {
                "content": "11. 測驗中狀態存在本機，重新整理可續作；完成後批次寫入 Attempts、AttemptAnswers 並更新 WrongQuestions／ReviewNotes。\n",
                "textStyle": {}
              }
            }
          ],
          "paragraphStyle": {
            "direction": "LEFT_TO_RIGHT",
            "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT"
          }
        },
        "startIndex": 1183
      },
      {
        "endIndex": 1322,
        "paragraph": {
          "elements": [
            {
              "endIndex": 1322,
              "startIndex": 1269,
              "textRun": {
                "content": "12. Google Sheet 是唯一可寫入 Source of Truth，不建立第二套永久資料庫。\n",
                "textStyle": {}
              }
            }
          ],
          "paragraphStyle": {
            "direction": "LEFT_TO_RIGHT",
            "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT"
          }
        },
        "startIndex": 1269
      },
      {
        "endIndex": 1462,
        "paragraph": {
          "elements": [
            {
              "endIndex": 1462,
              "startIndex": 1322,
              "textRun": {
                "content": "13. 技術採全新隔離專案：Next.js App Router + TypeScript + PWA，Google Apps Script Web App 作薄 API，Apps Script 原始碼放 repo /apps-script。部署 Vercel Preview。\n",
                "textStyle": {}
              }
            }
          ],
          "paragraphStyle": {
            "direction": "LEFT_TO_RIGHT",
            "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT"
          }
        },
        "startIndex": 1322
      },
      {
        "endIndex": 1544,
        "paragraph": {
          "elements": [
            {
              "endIndex": 1544,
              "startIndex": 1462,
              "textRun": {
                "content": "14. 全站繁中優先、Android 手機優先、答案整塊按鈕可點、無 hover-only、正文至少 16px、題幹 18–20px、答案按鈕高度至少 56px。\n",
                "textStyle": {}
              }
            }
          ],
          "paragraphStyle": {
            "direction": "LEFT_TO_RIGHT",
            "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT"
          }
        },
        "startIndex": 1462
      },
      {
        "endIndex": 1581,
        "paragraph": {
          "elements": [
            {
              "endIndex": 1581,
              "startIndex": 1544,
              "textRun": {
                "content": "15. 不做登入、多使用者、排行榜、AI 自動出題、複雜後台、花俏動畫。\n",
                "textStyle": {}
              }
            }
          ],
          "paragraphStyle": {
            "direction": "LEFT_TO_RIGHT",
            "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT"
          }
        },
        "startIndex": 1544
      },
      {
        "endIndex": 1682,
        "paragraph": {
          "elements": [
            {
              "endIndex": 1682,
              "startIndex": 1581,
              "textRun": {
                "content": "16. 不得修改或 Merge 到有何不可官網、Career OS 或任何既有網站 repo。建立新 repo／新 Vercel 專案，先提供 Preview，等我確認後再決定 Production。\n",
                "textStyle": {}
              }
            }
          ],
          "paragraphStyle": {
            "direction": "LEFT_TO_RIGHT",
            "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT"
          }
        },
        "startIndex": 1581
      },
      {
        "endIndex": 1683,
        "paragraph": {
          "elements": [
            {
              "endIndex": 1683,
              "startIndex": 1682,
              "textRun": {
                "content": "\n",
                "textStyle": {}
              }
            }
          ],
          "paragraphStyle": {
            "direction": "LEFT_TO_RIGHT",
            "namedStyleType": "NORMAL_TEXT"
          }
        },
        "startIndex": 1682
      },
      {
        "endIndex": 1700,
        "paragraph": {
          "elements": [
            {
              "endIndex": 1700,
              "startIndex": 1683,
              "textRun": {
                "content": "完成後不要只說「完成」。請回報：\n",
                "textStyle": {}
              }
            }
          ],
          "paragraphStyle": {
            "direction": "LEFT_TO_RIGHT",
